     <actual>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">Q1:

- Preparatory work is going on to launch the project.

- Responsible party is selected and RBA agreement is finalized.


Q2:
# 3 WASH facilities are at bidding and detail design stage to be rehabilitated

# 5320 students and women are benefitting from hygiene promotion activities in Tarim and Al Abr districts.


Q3:

# Rehabilitation of 3 WASH facilities in three communities namely; Laous, Mashtah and Hasat Al Maqateel that will benefit about 33,000 residents of Tarim has started. 

# 14068 students and women are benefitting from hygiene promotion activities in Tarim and Al Abr districts.


Q4:

# Rehabilitation of 3 WASH facilities in three communities nalemy; Laous, Mashtah and Hasat Al Maqateel that will benefit about 33,000 residents of Tarim reached 92%.

# 22,286 students and women are benefitting from hygiene promotion activities in Tarim and Al Abr districts.</narrative>
      </comment>
     </actual>
    </period>
